WEBVTT

00:06.600 --> 00:08.000
Issue orders

00:09.120 --> 00:10.520
Summon General Zu

00:10.880 --> 00:12.280
Yes

00:16.160 --> 00:16.920
Your servant

00:17.000 --> 00:18.667
Pays respects to Your Majesty

00:23.480 --> 00:24.880
Your Majesty's wound

00:25.400 --> 00:26.800
Is it better?

00:27.160 --> 00:28.560
I am well

00:28.640 --> 00:30.040
I summoned you today

00:30.360 --> 00:31.760
To discuss important matters

00:32.640 --> 00:34.440
Now that all directions are settled

00:34.520 --> 00:37.200
I must consider Xuan Kingdom's future

00:39.280 --> 00:40.680
For Xuan Kingdom's state

00:41.440 --> 00:42.560
What do you think

00:42.640 --> 00:44.307
I should pass this throne

00:44.640 --> 00:46.040
To whom?

00:55.520 --> 00:56.920
Since ancient times

00:57.000 --> 00:58.480
If there's a legitimate heir, establish the legitimate heir

00:58.560 --> 01:00.893
If no legitimate heir, establish the eldest

01:01.600 --> 01:03.000
I understand
